{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>No, my lord.</b> There is no need for the leaders of the people who are assembled to intercede with me." "<b>Hear me.</b> You, without any intermediary." "<b>The field I give to you.</b> In my thought, ever since you spoke." "<b>And the cave that is in it.</b> So that you need not pass through others' fields when you wish to bury." "<b>In the sight of the sons of my people I have given it to you; bury your dead.</b> In their sight I declare that I give it to you on condition that you may bury your dead there, just as you asked in saying <b>for a possession of a buryingplace</b>."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:13.918903429Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}